                'Contact Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles '
                'Kisii University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Posted on Oct '
                '18,2023 by Erick Oyaro RESEARCH Kisii University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting in Paris '
                'on 25-26 October 2023 Harnessing Science Dynamics to Transform Learning Dr. Pamella Wadende Senior '
                'Lecturer at School of Education and Human Resource Development is among the Participants at the '
                "UNESCO Expert Meeting on the Learning Sciences. The experts' meeting has been organized by UNESCO. "
                'The meeting aims to further the recommendations of the 2022 Transforming Education Summit and the '
                'United Nations Secretary General Vision Statement on Transforming Education . The latter articulates '
                'the importance of the curriculum and pedagogy while emphasizing the need for innovations, powered by '
                'but often neglected from Learning Sciences, to prepare the learners of today for a rapidly changing '
                'world. The meeting will also explore the role that Learning Sciences and the networks associated with '
                'these interdisciplinary areas of study could play to support inclusive, quality, and holistic '
                'learning and the work of the SDG 4 High-Level Steering Committee (HLSC) Functional Area 1 on '
                'evidence-based policy formulation and implementation. For more info visit: '
                'https://glhconnect.unesco.org/unesco-expert-meeting-learning-sciences mode_comment close Kisii '
                'University Support close Hi Welcome to Kisii University Customer Care Center. What do you need help '
