                'proposal for ethics review Contact Policies Partnerships Programmes Publications Funding '
                'Opportunities Funding Opportunities External Grants Contact Search term Search Kisii University: Web '
                'People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Recent Posts Kisii University to Participate at '
                'the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Oct 18 2023 . Erick Oyaro 2026 IUPAC-Soong Prize for '
                'Sustainable Chemistry – Call for Nominations International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry '
                '(IUPAC) Posted on Oct 06,2025 by The IUPAC-Soong Prize for Sustainable Chemistry is a high-profile '
                'prize awarded annually to an outstanding scientist for a breakthrough discovery or a conceptual '
                "advance, highlighting the discovery rather than the laureate's luminous career, as is the case for "
                'the Nobel Prize. Eligibility Anyone can be nominated, regardless of their background, affiliation, '
                'identity, or opinions Self-nominations are not allowed The Prize laureate will receive a certificate, '
                'a medal, a monetary award of $30,000 (USD), and travel expenses to reach the prize ceremony. In '
                'addition to the prize ceremony, the awardee will be invited to present a lecture at the National '
                'Taiwan University within two years of receiving the award. Nomination deadline is November 15, 2025 '
                'https://iupac.org/iupac-soong-prize-for-sustainable-chemistry-call-for-nominations/ Important Links '
