                'Partnerships Programmes Publications Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities External Grants '
                'Contact Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles '
                'Recent Posts Kisii University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Oct '
                '18 2023 . Erick Oyaro CFPs: Digitalization for Flexible and Resilient Energy Systems Program (Phase '
                'II) Posted on Apr 01,2025 by Deadline, 23 rd May, 2025 Following up on the COP29 in Baku, Azerbaijan, '
                'the Italian Ministry of Environment and Energy Security , in collaboration with the United Nations '
                'Environment Programme (UNEP) is launching the second phase of the International Energy Agency (IEA) '
                'led Digital Demand-Driven Electricity Networks (3DEN) Initiative , an inter-agency initiative. The '
                'initiative aims to accelerate global climate action and uptake of clean energy models, building on '
                'the success of Phase I. The second phase was kicked off with the launch of a call for pilot projects '
                'on digitalisation for flexible and resilient energy systems targeting eight countries – Brazil, South '
                'Africa, Morocco, Tunisia, Kenya, Nigeria, Ethiopia, and Tanzania. This expansion aligns with Italy’s '
                '“Piano Mattei” and the “Rome Process”, which aim to deepen partnerships between Italy and Africa, '
                'focusing on sustainable development and energy transition. Grant Overview The BASE Foundation has '
                'launched the call for pilot projects on Digitalization for Flexible and Resilient Energy Systems '
                'targeting eight countries. This expansion aligns with Italy’s “Piano Mattei” and the “Rome Process”, '
                'which aim to deepen partnerships between Italy and Africa, focusing on sustainable development and '
                'energy transition. Amount USD 500,000 and USD 2,000,000 Link: https://3den.energy-base.org/ Important '
