                'External Research Grants Awarded Ongoing Research Projects Research Ethics Review Resource Materials '
                'Review Process Guidelines on submitting research proposal for ethics review Contact Policies '
                'Partnerships Programmes Publications Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities External Grants '
                'Contact Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles '
                'Recent Posts Kisii University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Oct '
                '18 2023 . Erick Oyaro Collaborative Curriculum Development for Competency-Based STEM Education in '
                'Kenya Posted on Jan 22,2025 by Lead Researchers: Dr. George Ngwacho Areba, PhD & Prof. David Kimori, '
                'PhD This project, funded by the Carnegie African Diaspora Fellowship Program (CADFP), involves '
                'development of innovative pedagogies in Competency Based Curriculum (CBC) education, focusing on '
                'Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics (STEM) fields. The two-month project, scheduled for '
                'January 2025 to March 2025, will include developing new teaching approaches and mentoring '
                'postgraduate students in educational research. The project aims to enhance teaching methodologies and '
                'empower educators with the tools needed to strengthen STEM education in Kenya. Important Links '
                'Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube QUICK LINKS Funding Opportunities IMPORTANT LINKS EXTERNAL LINKS '
