                'Partnerships Programmes Publications Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities External Grants '
                'Contact Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles '
                'Recent Posts Kisii University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Oct '
                '18 2023 . Erick Oyaro Enhancing Climate Literacy and Action through Education in Isiolo (Kenya) and '
                'Ethiopia Posted on Jan 22,2025 by Lead Researcher: Dr. Jacquelyn Walubwa, PhD This project aims to '
                'improve climate literacy through educational strategies in Isiolo, Kenya, and Ethiopia. It focuses on '
                'integrating climate change knowledge into teaching, research, and community engagement to address the '
                'global climate crisis. The initiative will develop localized communication approaches and establish '
                'climate change information hubs, empowering communities with knowledge to foster informed climate '
                "action and resilience, supporting both the UN SDGs and Africa's Agenda 2063. Important Links Facebook "
                'Twitter Instagram YouTube QUICK LINKS Funding Opportunities IMPORTANT LINKS EXTERNAL LINKS '
