                '25-26 October 2023 Oct 18 2023 . Erick Oyaro ENHANCING LOCAL SOCIAL CAPITAL IN KENYA: ADAPTING RURAL '
                'LEADERSHIP TRAINING FOR SOUTHWEST KENYA Posted on Aug 04,2023 by This is a joint research project '
                'between Kisii University and University of Minnesota (UM), USA. The program will first adapt the UM '
