                'on submitting research proposal for ethics review Contact Policies Partnerships Programmes '
                'Publications Funding Opportunities Funding Opportunities External Grants Contact Search term Search '
                'Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Recent Posts Kisii '
                'University to Participate at the UNESCO Expert Meeting on 25-26 October 2023 Oct 18 2023 . Erick '
                'Oyaro Kisii University Youth Agribusiness Incubation Centre (YABIC) Posted on Jan 22,2025 by Project '
                'Lead: Prof. Samson Maobe, PhD The Kisii University Youth Agribusiness Incubation Centre (YABIC) is a '
                'project focused on nurturing research-driven innovations in agribusiness and translating them into '
                'job opportunities for young graduates. The centre offers a comprehensive incubation program, where '
                'graduates develop business plans for agro-based ventures based on scientific research. These plans '
                'are then supported and funded to become commercially viable. Since its inception, the Youth '
                'Agribusiness Incubation Centre (YABIC) has supported 107 graduates in launching successful '
                'agribusinesses, contributing to economic development and job creation in the region. Important Links '
