                'Library Assistant 1996 Jan – 1997 Jun Lecturer Sigalagala T.T.I. Education 2010-2015 Moi University '
                'PhD. Library and Information Sciences 2002 – 2006 Moi University MPhil. Library and Information '
                'Science 1990-1994 Moi University BSc. in Information Sciences 1988 -1989 Ndururumo High School Kenya '
                'Advanced Certificate of Education 1984 -1987 Njonjo Girls High School Kenya Certificate of Education '
                '(Division 2) 1976-1983 Our Lady of Victories Primary School Kenya Certificate of Primary Education '
                'Membership in Committees Scientific committee . African Institute in Indigenous Knowledge (AIIKS). '
