                'Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Back to News C.S '
                'Education, Hon. Julius Ogamba & KSU Vice Chancellor at Nyambaria High School Posted on Mar 10,2026 by '
                'kisii-university NEWS The Vice Chancellor today joined the Cabinet Secretary, Education, Hon. Julius '
                'Ogamba at Nyambaria High School to celebrate knowledge, progress, and a thoughtful reflection on the '
                'future of education. The occasion stood as a powerful reminder that learning is not only about '
                'achievement today, but about shaping the leaders, innovators, and problem-solvers of tomorrow. As a '
                'committed partner in academia, government, and research, Kisii University continues to extend its '
