                'search: Map Profiles Back to News HERI Africa Research Program Posted on Jan 23,2026 by '
                'kisii-university NEWS The HERI Africa Research Program is here, bold in vision, far-reaching in '
                'impact, and firmly at home with us. Today, alongside our colleagues from Education Sub-Saharan Africa '
                '(ESSA), we took the first decisive steps on a transformative journey that will culminate in the '
                'official launch of this prestigious program at our University on 18th February 2026. This is more '
                'than a beginning; it,s a commitment to research excellence, collaboration, and Africa-driven '
                'solutions. Watch this space, something remarkable is unfolding. mode_comment close Kisii University '
