                'Association (KSUSA) New Leadership Posted on Oct 22,2025 by kisii-university STUDENT LIFE Today, the '
                'spirit of leadership and service came alive as newly elected Kisii University Students Association '
                '(KSUSA) leaders took the oath of office, a proud moment marking the smooth and dignified handover of '
                'the tools of power. Presided over by our Vice Chancellor, Prof. Dr. Nathan O. Ogechi, the ceremony '
