                'Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Back to News KSU Donates Mattresses to '
                'Nyosia Mixed Secondary Posted on Mar 10,2025 by kisii-university NEWS Kisii University stood with '
                'Nyosia Mixed secondary donating 70 mattresses to the school after a fire had razed down the boys '
                'dormitory and paralyzed learning. In a wonderful event presided over by the Registrar AHRCS and the '
                'Schools Principal the University was able to demonstrate our borderless-ness and inclusivity within '
                'our County by standing with our neighbours. Kisii University continues to connect, support and uplift '
