                'News KSU Vice Chancellor joins academic community in celebrating Egerton University 86th year of '
                'service Posted on Feb 16,2026 by kisii-university NEWS Led by our Vice Chancellor, Kisii University '
                'proudly joined the academic community in celebrating Egerton University on the occasion of her 86th '
                'year of distinguished service, marked during today,s Open Day celebrations. This moment was more than '
                'a celebration, it was a powerful affirmation of unity, shared purpose, and the enduring spirit of '
                'scholarship. Kisii University stands shoulder to shoulder with fellow academic giants, committed to '
                'learning from one another, engaging meaningfully, and building networks that elevate higher education '
                'for the greater good. Congratulations to Egerton University on 86 remarkable years of impact and '
                'excellence. Here,s to an even brighter future, bold in vision, rich in collaboration, and '
                'transformative for generations to come. mode_comment close Kisii University Support close Hi Welcome '
