                'Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Back to News '
                'Minnesota State University Carnegie African Diaspora Fellowship Program Posted on Jul 23,2025 by '
                'kisii-university NEWS The Vice Chancellor hosted a delegation from Minnesota State University, '
                'Mankato which has partnered with the School of Education at Kisii University through the Carnegie '
                'African Diaspora Fellowship Program, This partnership focuses on enhancing STEM education and '
                'Competency-Based Education (CBE) at Kisii University. The collaboration aims to equip STEM students '
                'and faculty with 21st-century pedagogical competencies in teaching and learning, enabling them to '
                'compete globally. Kisii University continues to expand its internationalization agenda and '
