                'search: Map Profiles Back to News National Scouting Championships Posted on Aug 06,2025 by '
                'kisii-university STUDENT LIFE Our Scouts have glamorously emerged victorious in all their categories '
                'of the just ended, National Scouting Championships. From Best Male Troop, Best Female Troop, and Best '
                'Drill Team, to clinching the coveted title of Overall Best Institution in the Country, they have '
                'swept the awards with unmatched elegance and precision. This outstanding performance now earns them '
                'the honour of representing Kenya at the East African Scouting Competition to be held later this year '
                'in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. With unwavering finesse, excellence, and a spirit of inclusivity and '
