                'Web People Search Web Other ways to search: Map Profiles Back to News Nyamira University College '
                'Ground-breaking Ceremony Posted on Oct 24,2025 by kisii-university NEWS In a powerful display of '
                'vision, unity, and purpose, the Cabinet Secretary for Defence, Hon. Soipan Tuya, together with her '
                'Education counterpart, Hon. Julius Migos, today led the groundbreaking ceremony for the new Nyamira '
                'University College, a constituent college of Kisii University. This moment marks the dawn of a '
                'transformative journey one fuelled by the unwavering professionalism, dedication, and institutional '
                'excellence of Kisii University. With such a strong foundation, the future shines bright for Nyamira '
                'University College, as it rises to become a beacon of knowledge, innovation, and regional growth. The '
                'journey has begun and from here, it only gets better. mode_comment close Kisii University Support '
