                'University academic community with global ideas, boundless opportunities, and enriching international '
                'experiences. As Kisii University looks beyond the horizon to boldly advance its borderless and '
                'internationalization agenda, this engagement marks a powerful and fitting beginning. Through her '
                'presence on campus and participation in several side events, Dr. Schraeyen continues to generously '
                'share her wealth of experience, igniting conversations that broaden perspectives and open new '
