                'when required. REQUIREMENTS FOR APPOINTMENT Doctorate degree or a Master,s degree in the relevant '
                'area of specialization from a recognized University; All applicants qualifications (degrees) must be '
                'in the same field. At least two (2) years teaching experience in a University. APPLICATION PROCEDURE '
