                'Institution/University. Masters in Human Resource - Masters Bachelor,s degree with at least second '
                'Class Honours (Upper Division) and above OR Second Class Honours (Lower Division) with at least two '
                'years experience from the Date of Graduation. Bachelor of Human Resource Management; - Degree Mean '
                'Grade of C+ (plus) in KCSE with a C (plain) in Mathematics & English/Kiswahili OR Diploma in related '
                'field from a recognized institution. Diploma in Human Resource Management - Diploma Mean Grade C- in '
                'K.C.S.E with a D (Plain) in Mathematics OR Certificate in a related area with a credit pass from a '
