                'http://jassh.info/index.php/jassh (vi) Getui, N., Ichuloi, A., &Kandagor, D. (2023). “Diversification '
                'of Financial Sources for Sustainability of the Seventh Day Advent Church in South East Kenya Field”. '
                'Journal of Philosophy and Religion, 2(1), 121-132. https://doi.org/10.51317/jpr.v2i1.377 (vii) Getui, '
                'N., Ichuloi, A., &Kandagor, D. (2023). “Assessment of financial management systems for sustainability '
