                'pyrometry reflection errors in temperature measurement of gas turbine blade”, Measurement, 86 (2016) '
                '133-40. 3. Ketui Daniel,Chi Feng, Shan Gao, “Reflection error correction of gas turbine blade '
                'temperature”, Infrared Physics & Technology, 75 (2016) 153-9. 4. Ketui, Daniel, Feng, C., Gao, S. '
                '"Application of multispectral radiation thermometry in temperature measurement of thermal barrier '
                'coated surfaces". Measurement. 92, 218-23, 2016. 5. Tuwei Abraham, Ketui Daniel and Njogu Samson, '
                '“Effects of Annealing and Oxygen/Nitrogen Ratio on Transmittance of Copper Oxynitride Thin Films”, '
                'International Journal of Thin Films Science and Technology, 5 (2016). 6. Shan Gao, Wang Lixin, Chi '
                'Feng, Ketui Daniel, “Analysis and improvement of gas turbine blade temperature measurement error”, '
                'Measurement Science and Technology, 26 (2015) 105203. 7. Shan. Gao, Wang Lixin, Chi Feng, Xiao Yihan, '
