                'Role of Homestay Facilities In Improving Local Community Livelihood In Lake Victoria Kenya Tourism '
                'Circuit. ATLAS Africa Conference 3rd to 5th June 2015 Dar Es Salaam, Tanzania. Mukolwe, E., Korir, '
                'J.,Buyeke,E.,Wafula,M.,Musyoki, J. Effects of interpersonal conflict on Organizational Performance of '
