                'performance of selected hotels in Nairobi, Kenya. Moi University, 7th Annual International '
                'Conference, 6-10 September, 2011, Eldoret, Kenya. Classes taught: Undergraduate classes: Housekeeping '
                'and laundry operations and management Food and beverage production Food and beverage service Food and '
                'beverage sales Hospitality service operations Food and beverage management Masters class: Critical '
                'perspective in Leisure and Tourism Other relevant links: • ORCID: '
