                'equality and freedom from discrimination provided for under Article 27; 3. Affirmative action '
                'programmes provided for under Articles 55 and 56; 4. Principles of integrity under the Leadership and '
                'Integrity Act, 2012 (No. 19 of 2012); 5. The principles of public finance under Article 201; 6. The '
                'values and principles of public service as provided for under Article 232; 7. Principles governing '
                'the procurement profession, international norms; 8. Maximisation of value for money; 9. Promotion of '
