                'Science & Peace Studies ) Mission ( Political Science and Peace Studies) Goals (Political Science and '
                'Peace Studies) Teaching and training (Political Science and Peace Studies) Research and publications '
                '(Political Science and Peace Studies) Partnerships (Political Science and Peace Studies) Outreach '
                '(Political Science and Peace Studies) Career Opportunities/employability PROGRAMS TEAM NEWS EVENTS '
                'DOWNLOADS RESEARCH Research and publications (Political Science and Peace Studies) Back to Home The '
                'department of Political Science and Peace Studies undertakes and encourages conducting of field '
                'research on contemporary security areas, governance and leadership, justice and peace and conflict. '
                'It therefore carries out research and provides adequate resources to the researchers to enable them '
                'carry out effective research. Dissemination of information and findings will be made promptly to '
                'encourage the implementation of the given recommendation by the relevant stakeholders. Research being '
                'one of the a core areas of the specialization;Â the Institute will have regular publication, '
                'conferences, presentation of papers and an annual journal that will be made available to scholars in '
