                'Agricultural Resource Economics and Management Programmes PhD in Agricultural Education& Extension '
                'Msc. in Agricultural Extension Bachelor of Science in Agricultural Education & Extension (AGED) '
                'Bachelor of Science in Agricultural Extension & Rural Development Diploma in Agricultural Economics '
